.TH MYGREP 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for lines containing a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Searches every line of the open file stream
.I fp
for occurrences of the substring
.I search_str
and allocates an array of matching lines into
.I *matches.
The caller is responsible for freeing each returned string and the
array itself.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of matching lines found, or -1 on failure.
.SH AUTHOR
